        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": {
          "text": "Food was not very nice given the price. Ordered a pork cutlet rice with egg. The pork was probably too overcooked so it was rough and quite difficult to bite open. And they also seemed to be too busy serving the VIP customers up stair that we waited more than 20 minutes for our food, the resturant wasn’t even full. Won’t recommend.\n\n食物質素一般但價錢貴。個吉列豬扒鞋到好難咬開。同埋佢地好似樓上有貴客serve緊，我地啲野食等左20分鐘先有。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
